item.text:
{
  "decisions": [
    {
      "candidate_id": "N1201",
      "proposed_relation": "broader_than",
      "model_reason": "左侧讨论受离子分子特征影响的塞贝克系数，未限定符号；右侧明确限定为产生阳离子的掺杂条件下的正塞贝克系数。正值限定构成该量的一个类别，因此左侧较宽；右侧的正号不能删除。",
      "left_evidence": {
        "mention_id": "iTE:P0334:n3",
        "quote_span": "the number of rotatable bonds and the octanol-water partition coefficient of ions negatively affect Seebeck coefficients"
      },
      "right_evidence": {
        "mention_id": "iTE:P0387:n4",
        "quote_span": "upon doping with cation-generating species like poly(4-styrene sulfonic acid) (PSS), it displays positive Seebeck coefficient values"
      }
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "N1202",
      "proposed_relation": "uncertain",
      "model_reason": "左侧是块体Cu1.94Al0.02Se的热电优值，原文提到超离子机制，但没有定义该优值所计入的载流贡献；右侧明确为离子优值ZT i。两侧缺少可对照的定义或计算式，无法确认它们是同一评价量或具有类型包含关系，也不能由左侧的超离子机制直接推定其优值就是离子优值。",
      "left_evidence": {
        "mention_id": "iTE:P0716:n3",
        "quote_span": "we further enhance the superionic mechanism by increasing and better aligning lamellae in bulk Cu1.94Al0.02Se, resulting in a large thermoelectric figure of merit of 2.62 at 756 degrees C."
      },
      "right_evidence": {
        "mention_id": "iTE:P0363:n2",
        "quote_span": "record-high ionic figures of merit (ZT i) of 49.5 and 32.2 are achieved"
      }
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "N1203",
      "proposed_relation": "related_to",
      "model_reason": "左侧是BaAgSb沿c轴的晶格热导率，保留晶格分量和方向限定；右侧是RbZn4P3的总热导率，原文明确利用晶格热导率估计总热导率。二者属于分量与总量的关联，且来自不同材料，不能判为同义或分类学上下位；共同的超低数值特征不改变该区别。",
      "left_evidence": {
        "mention_id": "iTE:P0631:n2",
        "quote_span": "ultra-low lattice thermal conductivity of 0.59 W.m(-1).K-1 along c-axis at 800 K"
      },
      "right_evidence": {
        "mention_id": "iTE:P0974:n1",
        "quote_span": "The lattice thermal conductivity is estimated using Slack's equation to get the true value of total thermal conductivity. We obtain an ultra-low total thermal conductivity"
      }
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "N1204",
      "proposed_relation": "equivalent_to",
      "model_reason": "两侧均指氧化还原水凝胶热电器件的输出电压，角色一致。左侧由应变调节氧化还原动力学而改变该电压；右侧由光热层供热、氧化还原水凝胶发电，并给出稳定电压值。应变调制与光照供热是不同工作条件，未改变节点所指的电压输出概念；右侧数值作为测量属性保留。",
      "left_evidence": {
        "mention_id": "TG:P0073:n3",
        "quote_span": "mechanical strain modulates the hydrogel's redox kinetics, thereby influencing thermoelectric voltage output"
      },
      "right_evidence": {
        "mention_id": "TG:P0156:n3",
        "quote_span": "This device consists of a cotton/PPy photothermal layer and a thermoelectric hydrogel, with [Fe(CN)6]3-/4- serving as a redox couple. The PTE device demonstrated remarkable stability, sustaining a consistent voltage output of 31.42 mV under the solar intensity of 150 mW cm-2."
      }
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "N1205",
      "proposed_relation": "related_to",
      "model_reason": "左侧同时指高电导率和高热导率，分别关联电荷输运与散热；右侧只报告超离子材料的电导率。电导率是左侧复合节点的一个组成量，不能将复合节点折叠为它，也不能把这种组成关系当作类型上下位。右侧未分解载流贡献，不据此补定其导电机制。",
      "left_evidence": {
        "mention_id": "iTE:P1616:n1",
        "quote_span": "its high electrical and thermal conductivities may reduce its thermoelectric efficiency"
      },
      "right_evidence": {
        "mention_id": "iTE:P0823:n2",
        "quote_span": "superionic materials having electrical conductivities of the order of 10(-4) to 10(-3) S cm(-1) at room temperature"
      }
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "N1206",
      "proposed_relation": "equivalent_to",
      "model_reason": "左侧的双极贡献由增大带隙、减少少数载流子而受到抑制，语境指向双极载流子输运机制；右侧的双极导电通过塞贝克系数补偿影响热电优值。两侧角色均为机制过程，分别在掺杂AgSbTe2和Yb/Ca锑化物中描述同一双极输运机制。材料、抑制方式和观察后果不同，不改变该机制指代，左侧也未限定为某个单独物理量的双极分量。",
      "left_evidence": {
        "mention_id": "iTE:P1091:n2",
        "quote_span": "The sulfur substitution at the tellurium site significantly suppresses the bipolar contribution by increasing the bandgap/reducing minority charge carriers"
      },
      "right_evidence": {
        "mention_id": "iTE:P1420:n1",
        "quote_span": "bipolar conduction produces a compensated Seebeck coefficient and consequently a low zT"
      }
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "N1207",
      "proposed_relation": "uncertain",
      "model_reason": "左侧iTE:P0676:n2的“these devices”缺少器件先行指代，且未说明性能指标；右侧iTE:P0918:n2虽明确为低湿条件下的i-TE器件性能，也未给出具体评价量。仅凭二者都谈器件性能，无法确认测量对象、器件层级及评价内容一致。",
      "left_evidence": {
        "mention_id": "iTE:P0676:n2",
        "quote_span": "The performance of these devices is a complex function of thermodynamic and transport properties of the electrolyte."
      },
      "right_evidence": {
        "mention_id": "iTE:P0918:n2",
        "quote_span": "the performance of the i-TE device at low -humidity conditions is drastically improved."
      }
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "N1208",
      "proposed_relation": "uncertain",
      "model_reason": "当前角色不一致：iTE:P0627:n2为quantity，iTE:P0390:n2为performance_function。物理对象也需要区分：左侧测量的是受离子凝胶静电调控的单层石墨烯热电输运性质，右侧是具有阳离子选择性的水凝胶电解质的离子热电性质。离子凝胶作为调控介质不足以证明左侧测量的就是离子热电输运；现有引用不能建立统一概念。",
      "left_evidence": {
        "mention_id": "iTE:P0627:n2",
        "quote_span": "thermoelectric transport properties of centimeter-sized monolayer CVD graphene, electrostatically controlled by a high-capacity ionic gel"
      },
      "right_evidence": {
        "mention_id": "iTE:P0390:n2",
        "quote_span": "possessing cross-linked network with excellent cation selectivity, while the ionic thermoelectric properties are further improved in the presence of NaCl."
      }
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "N1209",
      "proposed_relation": "related_to",
      "model_reason": "左侧指形成超价键所改善的热电性能；右侧把热电性能和机械性能并列组成一个复合节点。热电性能构成右侧评价内容的一部分，但右侧还保留独立的机械性能维度，因此是组成内容上的关联，不能直接等同，也不构成分类学上下位。",
      "left_evidence": {
        "mention_id": "iTE:P0675:n2",
        "quote_span": "Thermoelectric performance can also be significantly improved by forming metavalent bonds."
      },
      "right_evidence": {
        "mention_id": "iTE:P0412:n5",
        "quote_span": "thereby improving both thermoelectric and mechanical performance."
      }
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "N1210",
      "proposed_relation": "related_to",
      "model_reason": "左侧是含碘离子的水凝胶热电性能，具体由热电势系数和峰值功率输出的改善体现；右侧同时评价热电和机械性能。两侧有热电评价内容的关联，但右侧的机械性能不能删除；这种复合评价与其中一个评价维度的关系不能判为同义或类型包含。",
      "left_evidence": {
        "mention_id": "iTE:P0420:n3",
        "quote_span": "This molecularly tailored approach markedly amplifies thermoelectric performance, achieving a high thermopower of 2.21 mV/K and a tenfold enhancement in peak power output"
      },
      "right_evidence": {
        "mention_id": "iTE:P0412:n5",
        "quote_span": "thereby improving both thermoelectric and mechanical performance."
      }
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "N1211",
      "proposed_relation": "related_to",
      "model_reason": "两侧均使用塞贝克系数表征热电响应，但左侧明确关联i-TEHs中的选择性离子迁移，右侧明确限定为3DMG的系数，并关联EDL栅控对电子结构的调节。二者在响应量上相关，但载流语境和右侧材料限定不能删除，不能作为同一概念合并；左侧在原文中也不是覆盖所有材料和载流机制的泛称。",
      "left_evidence": {
        "mention_id": "iTE:P0344:n4",
        "quote_span": "improves the selective ion migration capability of i-TEHs, achieving a high Seebeck coefficient of 14.39 mV K-1"
      },
      "right_evidence": {
        "mention_id": "iTE:P0641:n3",
        "quote_span": "Continuous and reversible control of the Seebeck coefficient of 3DMG highlights the effectiveness of EDL gating in manipulating the electronic structures of such bulk and porous material."
      }
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "N1212",
      "proposed_relation": "uncertain",
      "model_reason": "当前角色不一致：iTE:P0938:n4为quantity，iTE:P0608:n4为performance_function，按规则填uncertain。语义上左侧仅指离子电动效应产生的流动电势，右侧并列包含离子热电势和流动电势，分别对应温度梯度与水蒸发驱动。两者具有分量与复合节点的关联，不能折叠为同义，也不能据组成关系判定上下位。",
      "left_evidence": {
        "mention_id": "iTE:P0938:n4",
        "quote_span": "the streaming potential resulting from the ionic electrokinetic effect and the ionic thermoelectric potential originating from the Soret effect"
      },
      "right_evidence": {
        "mention_id": "iTE:P0608:n4",
        "quote_span": "The thermal gradient and the water evaporation drive selective ion transport through the charged nanochannels, which generates ionic thermoelectric and streaming potentials, respectively."
      }
    }
  ]
}
